        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate New Contract Line Details"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772528971125"
          },
          "code": "PRJ_PJE_LLM_GENERATE_NEW_CONTRACT_LINE_DETAILS",
          "id": "1772528579217",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772528579219_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are contract line and name generater based on the given policy. You are provided with following details.\n\n1) Existing Contract Lines\n2) New Contract Lines to be created\n3) Optional Policies provided as textual data\n\n---\n\n### Input:\n\n### Existing Contract Lines:\n {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJE_CODE_CONSOLIDATE_CREATE_LINES_AND_LINKAGES.$output.result.contractLinesForAnalysis}} \n\n### New Contract Lines:\n {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJE_CODE_CONSOLIDATE_CREATE_LINES_AND_LINKAGES.$output.result.createContractLines}} \n\n### Policies (Textual Input):\n\nPolicy for LineNumber:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarUqPolicyOptions.ContractLineNumberPolicy}} \n\nPolicy for LineName:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarUqPolicyOptions.ContractLineNamePolicy}} \n\n-- \n\n### Your Task:\n\nFor each new contract line, generate:\n- lineNumber\n- lineName\n\nLineNumber Rules:\n- If a LineNumber policy is provided, interpret and apply it strictly.\n- Contract line numbers must be integers.\n- Continue numbering sequentially based on the highest existing LineNumber unless the policy specifies a different rule.\n- Ensure uniqueness of generated lineNumber.\n- If no LineNumber policy is provided, default to sequential integer increment.\n\nLineName Rules:\n- If a LineName policy is provided, interpret and apply it strictly.\n- If no LineName policy is provided, follow the existing naming pattern.\n- If existing LineName equals LineNumber, maintain the same pattern.\n\n### General Rules:\n- Do not modify existing contract lines.\n- Generate values only for new contract lines.\n- Return only the required JSON output.\n- Do not include explanations or additional text.\n\n### \n\nOutput Format:\n```\n{\n  \"result\": [\n    {\n      \"Id\": \"<Id from New Contract Lines input>\",\n      \"lineNumber\": \"<GeneratedLineNumber>\",\n      \"lineName\": \"<GeneratedLineName>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"result\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"Id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"lineNumber\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"lineName\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"Id\",\"lineNumber\",\"lineName\"]}}},\"required\":[\"result\"]}\n",
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5523,
            "y": 21184
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Capture New Contract Line Details",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let newCLData = $context.$nodes.PRJ_PJE_LLM_GENERATE_NEW_CONTRACT_LINE_DETAILS.$output.result;\n\nlet impactDetailsChanges =  $context.$variables.prjPjeVarUqImpactDetailsChanges;\n\nlet taskDetailsMap = $context.$variables.prjPjeVarUqTasksDetailsMap;\n\n// For each newCLData object, find the corresponding object in impactDetailsChanges.ContractLineChanges\n    // and copy lineNumber and lineName\n    newCLData.forEach(item => {\n      const match = impactDetailsChanges.ContractLineChanges.find(cl => cl.Id === item.Id);\n      if (match) {\n        match.LineNumber = item.lineNumber;\n        match.LineName = item.lineName;\n      }\n    });\n\n    //let missingTasks = [];\n    // Traverse all ContractLineChanges and populate TaskLinkages if empty\n    // impactDetailsChanges.ContractLineChanges.forEach(cl => {\n    //   if (cl.TaskLinkages && cl.TaskLinkages.length === 0) {\n    //     const matchingLinks = impactDetailsChanges.ContractLineLinkChanges.filter(lc => lc.LineId === cl.LineId);\n    //     matchingLinks.forEach(lc => {\n    //       const clProjElementId = lc.Status === \"FOUND\" ? lc.CLProjElementId : lc.RequiredLinkTaskId;\n    //       const taskInfo = taskDetailsMap[clProjElementId] || {};\n    //       if (taskInfo.TaskName && taskInfo.TaskNumber) {\n    //         cl.TaskLinkages.push({\n    //           TaskName: taskInfo.TaskName,\n    //           TaskNumber: taskInfo.TaskNumber,\n    //           CLProjElementId: clProjElementId\n    //         });\n    //       } else {\n    //         cl.TaskLinkages.push({\n    //           CLProjElementId: clProjElementId\n    //         });\n\n    //         missingTasks.push(clProjElementId);\n    //       }\n    //     });\n    //   }\n    // });\n\nlet data = {};\ndata.newCLData = newCLData;\ndata.ImpactDetailsChanges = impactDetailsChanges;\n//data.missingTasks = missingTasks;\n\nreturn data;"
          },
