        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Extract Context"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777369591877"
          },
          "code": "PRJ_PJE_LLM_EXTRACT_CONTEXT",
          "id": "1777368724547",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777368724547_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI assistant that analyzes user conversations to extract structured context.\n\n## Inputs\n\nCurrent User Message:\n{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nConversation History:\n{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\nStrategic Agent Chat History:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvStrategicAgentChatHistory}}\n\nInherited Active Atomic Agent Details:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvActiveAtomicAgentDetails}}\n\nInherited Atomic Agent Response History:\n{{($context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvActiveAtomicAgentDetails && $context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvActiveAtomicAgentDetails.atomicAgentResponseHistory) ? $context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvActiveAtomicAgentDetails.atomicAgentResponseHistory : null}}\n\nPrevious Workflow Stage:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvWorkflowStage}}\n\nPrior Change Order Selection Context:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvRoutingContext}}\n\nPending Approval Context:\n{{$context.$variables.prjPjeVarConvApprovalContext}}\n\n## Task\n\nIdentify the primary context of the current user message using the current message, inherited active atomic-agent details, inherited atomic-agent response history, prior selection context, pending approval context, and conversation history.\n\nExtract:\n1. ContextType: Must be either \"Project\" or \"ChangeOrder\"\n2. ContextValue: The specific identifier, name, or placeholder associated with that context\n\n## Critical Rule\n\n- ContextType MUST be null if ContextValue is null.\n- Do NOT infer or return ContextType unless a valid ContextValue is clearly identified in the current message or inherited context.\n\n## Context Resolution Priority\n\n1. Extract explicit identifiers from Current User Message first:\n- Explicit Change Order identifier patterns:\n  - \"Change Order <id>\"\n  - \"CO <id>\"\n  - standalone numeric id with implement action, for example \"implement 12345\"\n- Explicit Project reference patterns:\n  - \"Project <name>\"\n  - \"<name> project\"\n  - known project-name phrase from current message\n\n2. Resolve follow-up references from inherited context:\n- Use Prior Change Order Selection Context first.\n- Then use Inherited Atomic Agent Response History, including all prior assistant response tables, rows, text, and raw child output.\n- Then use Inherited Active Atomic Agent Details contextDetails and atomicAgentResponse.\n- Then use Strategic Agent Chat History and Conversation History.\n- If the current user message references a displayed row by ordinal or deictic phrase, map it to a concrete ChangeDocumentNumber from the most recent relevant list.\n- Supported references include \"first one\", \"second one\", \"third one\", \"last one\", \"that change order\", \"selected change order\", \"proceed with it\", \"implement it\", and \"go ahead with that\".\n- Return ContextType = \"ChangeOrder\" and ContextValue = the resolved ChangeDocumentNumber.\n- Do not resolve an ordinal if no prior list is available or the ordinal is outside the displayed list.\n\n3. Resolve pending approval decisions:\n- When Previous Workflow Stage or Pending Approval Context indicates WAIT_CONTRACT_APPROVAL_DECISION, use Pending Approval Context and inherited active atomic-agent details to preserve the same change order.\n- For approval or rejection follow-ups, return the pending ChangeOrderNumber when available; otherwise return the pending ChangeOrderId only if no number is available.\n\n4. If BOTH project and change order are mentioned:\n- If a valid Change Order identifier is explicitly present, return:\n  - ContextType = \"ChangeOrder\"\n  - ContextValue = <that change order identifier>\n- Else if only project is specific and change order is generic, for example \"implement change order for <project>\", return:\n  - ContextType = \"Project\"\n  - ContextValue = <project name>\n- Do NOT return \"ChangeOrder\" when no concrete change-order value is present.\n\n5. Null safety:\n- If no concrete identifier/value can be extracted, return:\n  - ContextType = null\n  - ContextValue = null\n\n## Additional Guidelines\n\n- Only return ContextType as one of:\n  - \"Project\"\n  - \"ChangeOrder\"\n- If a change order is mentioned with explicit value, set ContextType = \"ChangeOrder\".\n- If only a project is mentioned, set ContextType = \"Project\".\n- If the message contains a standalone numeric identifier with an action, infer it as a ChangeOrder.\n- Prefer the most recent same-agent response history over generic chat history.\n- Extract only ONE primary context.\n- Preserve all relevant prior state; do not require the user to re-enter details that are present in inherited context.\n\n## Validation Rule\n\n- ContextType = \"ChangeOrder\" requires a non-null concrete ContextValue for the change order.\n- ContextType = \"Project\" requires a non-null project ContextValue.\n- If either validation fails, return both as null.\n\n## Output Format\n\nReturn strict JSON only, with no markdown and no extra text:\n\n{\n  \"ContextType\": \"<Project | ChangeOrder | null>\",\n  \"ContextValue\": \"<value or null>\"\n}\n\n## Sample Snapshots\n\n### Example 1\nUser Input:\nImplement approved change orders in this Building Construction\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"ContextType\": \"Project\",\n  \"ContextValue\": \"Building Construction\"\n}\n\n### Example 2\nUser Input:\nImplement Change Order [ChangeOrderNumber]\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"ContextType\": \"ChangeOrder\",\n  \"ContextValue\": \"[ChangeOrderNumber]\"\n}\n\n### Example 3\nPrevious Workflow Stage:\nWAIT_CHANGE_ORDER_SELECTION\n\nInherited Atomic Agent Response History:\n[{\"assistantResponse\":{\"agent_response\":[{\"display_type\":\"table\",\"rows\":{\"items\":[{\"changeOrder\":\"18090\",\"project\":\"SV REST Agent Testing 01\"},{\"changeOrder\":\"18091\",\"project\":\"SV REST Agent Testing 01\"}]}}]}}]\n\nCurrent User Message:\nImplement the first one\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"ContextType\": \"ChangeOrder\",\n  \"ContextValue\": \"18090\"\n}\n\n### Example 4\nPrevious Workflow Stage:\nWAIT_CONTRACT_APPROVAL_DECISION\n\nPending Approval Context:\n{\"prjPjeVarUqChangeOrderNumber\":\"24083\",\"prjPjeVarUqContractId\":12345}\n\nCurrent User Message:\nApproved, proceed\n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"ContextType\": \"ChangeOrder\",\n  \"ContextValue\": \"24083\"\n}\n"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{\"ContextType\":{\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]},\"ContextValue\":{\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]}},\"required\":[\"ContextType\",\"ContextValue\"]}\n",
